  "recordSet": [],
  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "TaskCraft",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tDataset Card for TaskCraft\n\t\n\n\nTaskCraft is a multi-modal benchmark dataset featuring tasks ranging from simple (1-step) to expert-level (4-step+). It contains over 40,000 meticulously curated task instances designed to advance research in:\n\nAgent-based task processing\nTool invocation systems\nMulti-step reasoning\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tDataset Details\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tTool Utilization\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\nTool Category\nInstances\n\n\n\t\t\nPDF Processor\n13,400+\n\n\nHTML Parser\n19,200+\n\n\nImage Analyzer\n8,100+\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/PersonalAILab/TaskCraft.",
  "alternateName": [
    "PersonalAILab/TaskCraft",
    "taskcraft_dataset"
  ],
